    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch into the exciting universe of <strong>Pinball</strong> and get ready for a <strong>Pachinko</strong> fused experience filled with playful characters, ramps and bumpers. Choose between different characters and unleash their unique hero power such as time rewind and more! Aim with precision, time well and choose wisely. Flip your way through different realms, score big and experience the thrill of arcade fun. Get ready to flip out in <strong>FlipScapes</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take off to different worlds and unique environments with this pachinko pinball mix. From underwater wonders to scorching deserts, to the vastness of outer space, you'll bounce, flip and slide! Choose carefully between different heroes with their unique powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176580/extras/6705a0d5097def0a8049341e597992cc.avif?t=1753136453\" /></div>Meet Callisto, a curious cutie who is always on the lookout for new places to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176580/extras/6e25d2229fca47cc879dd53702bf11ac.avif?t=1753136453\" /></div>Rage flip through the playfield with Tuhin, blow up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176580/extras/2f4a985a9bb918cddd13f970532b6686.avif?t=1753136453\" /></div>The time-warping capabilities of Cronus are unmatched!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176580/extras/0ea0d626efa80f099ea5891203e54567.avif?t=1753136453\" /></div>Discover the magic of flower power with Aspen and her overpowered ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176580/extras/da549f2ec3d33b7473e4e03e992044a1.avif?t=1753136453\" /></div>Aukai has the ability to call upon his fish companions for assistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mystical Genie will guide you on your pinball pachinko journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176580/extras/d20e27455ee09e60451585dcbef8f145.avif?t=1753136453\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play characters with unique active and passive powers. Level up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover multiple worlds with their own stories that you can explore with your chosen hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack and reactive music while playing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast off to the celestial heights of the leaderboards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements such as &quot;Win 5 level using only the left flipper&quot; and &quot;Ace Score&quot; for levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great on Steam Deck and full controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to check out the <strong>Downloadable Soundtrack!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game uses Epic Online Services (EOS). You can play <strong>Offline</strong> if you want. However, playing <strong>Online</strong> enables cloud save, achievements &amp; leaderboards.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch into the exciting universe of <strong>Pinball</strong> and get ready for a <strong>Pachinko</strong> fused experience filled with playful characters, ramps and bumpers. Choose between different characters and unleash their unique hero power such as time rewind and more! Aim with precision, time well and choose wisely. Flip your way through different realms, score big and experience the thrill of arcade fun. Get ready to flip out in <strong>FlipScapes</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take off to different worlds and unique environments with this pachinko pinball mix. From underwater wonders to scorching deserts, to the vastness of outer space, you'll bounce, flip and slide! Choose carefully between different heroes with their unique powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176580/extras/6705a0d5097def0a8049341e597992cc.avif?t=1753136453\" /></div>Meet Callisto, a curious cutie who is always on the lookout for new places to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176580/extras/6e25d2229fca47cc879dd53702bf11ac.avif?t=1753136453\" /></div>Rage flip through the playfield with Tuhin, blow up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176580/extras/2f4a985a9bb918cddd13f970532b6686.avif?t=1753136453\" /></div>The time-warping capabilities of Cronus are unmatched!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"